RFC 1035 is a foundational Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF) specification published in November 1987. It defines the exact technical implementation, packet formats, and protocols for the Domain Name System (DNS), which translates human-readable domain names into numerical IP addresses.

https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc1035